==Round of 16==

===Spain vs Brazil===
Brazil – who had only kept [[Carvalho Leite]] from the squad participating in the [[1930 FIFA World Cup|previous edition of the World Cup]] – were outclassed by Spain in the first half, who scored thrice. In the second half, Spanish players played more complacently. [[Leônidas (footballer, born 1913)|Leônidas]] pulled one back for Brazil, then he scored again moments later, but the goal was disallowed for offside. Later, [[Ricardo Zamora]] saved a penalty from [[Waldemar de Brito]].<ref name="fiedler" />

