===Hungary vs Egypt===
Hungary scored twice in 31 minutes. Rather than being disheartened, Egypt showed a positive attitude and leveled with two goals from [[Abdulrahman Fawzi]]. In the second half, Hungary played better and dictated the tempo, scoring two more goals and deserving to reach the quarter-finals.<ref name="fiedler" />

