===Czechoslovakia vs Romania===
Romania were the underdogs, yet they went ahead after just 11 minutes with a close range goal from [[Ștefan Dobay]]. After [[Silviu Bindea]] missed an opportunity to double Romania's advantage, Czechoslovakia scored twice and held on for the victory.<ref name="fiedler" />

