===Austria vs France===
France took the lead with a goal from [[Jean Nicolas]], who had suffered a head injury in the early stages of the match. Austria drew level on the brink of half time thanks to a goal from the star [[Matthias Sindelar]]. An uneventful second half followed, so the match became the first in the history of World Cup to go to extra time. In the extra time, Austria prevailed and scored twice before France got a late second goal from the spot.<ref name="fiedler"/>

