===Germany vs Sweden===
Pouring rain influenced the match, which saw very few notable moments in the first half. In the second half, [[Ernst Andersson]] suffered a head injury, and Germany took the lead with [[Karl Hohmann]] while the Swedish player was off. Hohmann scored again three minutes later. Sweden managed to get a goal back, but their subsequent efforts were not enough and Germany progressed to the first of many semi-finals.<ref name="fiedler" />

