===Czechoslovakia vs Switzerland===
In a well-balanced game, Switzerland took the lead with [[Leopold Kielholz|Kielholz]] thanks to a counter-attacking play. Czechoslovakia equalized soon after with [[František Svoboda]], who turned a chance created by [[Jiří Sobotka]] into a goal. In the second half, although Switzerland dominated the ball possession, it was Czechoslovakia scoring twice and holding on for the victory.<ref name="fiedler" />

