==Semi-finals==

===Italy vs Austria===
A torrential downpour hampered the Austrians' passing game while benefiting the more varied Italian game. Italy took the lead when a ball broke free from the Austrian goalkeeper because of an intervention by [[Giuseppe Meazza]]. The ball then hit the post and was turned into goal by a perfectly positioned [[Enrique Guaita]]. In the second half, Austrian efforts to equalize were stopped by [[Gianpiero Combi]], and Italy managed to hold on for the victory.<ref name="fiedler" />

