===Czechoslovakia vs Germany===
The game proved to be a clash of styles, with a more technical Czechoslovakia facing a  physical German side. Czechoslovakia took the lead in the first half, but Germany drew level in the second half when [[František Plánička]] could not keep out a tame shot by [[Rudolf Noack]]. The Germany goal stimulated the Czechoslovak side. Czechoslovakia took advantage of their finesse and attacking prowess to score twice with [[Oldřich Nejedlý]], who completed a hat-trick.<ref name="fiedler" />

